      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a relief to finally be honest about the exhaustion you've been carrying for fifteen years. Leaving is the only way to stop the pain of feeling like a failure, and you deserve to rest before you even consider what comes next. There is no shame in walking away from a life that no longer serves you, and your worth isn't defined by a single institution's decision.",
