      "content": "rest. god. i don't even know what that means anymore. like my whole identity for 15 years was the work. the articles, the lectures, the students. if i stop that what am i even resting AS. \n\nmy husband keeps saying we'll figure it out but he doesn't get it. he has a career. he knows who he is when he wakes up in the morning. i genuinely don't. \n\nhonestly the thing that keeps hitting me tonight is just... what was the point. like what was any of it FOR. i'm 46 and i feel like my life already happened and i just... missed it somehow",
